    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44774" root="&#xA;                        وهن&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْهَنَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He,</i> or <i>it, weakened him:</i> [<i>rendered
him languid, languid and faint,</i> or <i>lax in the
joints; enervated him, unnerved him,</i> or <i>broke
his energy; rendered him cowardly:</i> (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهَنَ</span>:)]
(S, Msb, K:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهَنَهُ</span></b> , (S, Mgh, Msb, K,) but
the former is the better, (Msb,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهَّنَهُ</span></b> .
(S, K.)

